OL,4,G0350FWitness History
OL,5,     GIn 2015, the street artist
OL,6,     Gtransformed a derelict outdoor
OL,7,     Gswimming pool into a dystopian
OL,8,     G'bemusement park' in Weston-super-
OL,9,     GMare, England. It closed five
OL,10,     Gweeks later.
